# ─── LLM provider ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UNMAPPED uses an LLM in three places: Skills Signal mapping, Nia chat,
# and the Durability Coach. Set ONE of the keys below and you're live.
# Without either key the app still works, just in deterministic offline
# mode (fuzzy match for skills, rule-based fallback for Nia + Coach).

# OpenAI — set this if you want to use OpenAI (GPT) for the LLM features.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic — alternative; if both are set, OpenAI wins by default.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional explicit override when both keys are present.
# Values: openai | anthropic
# UNMAPPED_LLM_PROVIDER=openai

# ─── Per-feature model overrides (optional) ─────────────────────────────
# Defaults are sensible for the active provider:
#   OpenAI:    gpt-4o-mini   (cheap & fast; gpt-4o is ~10x more expensive)
#   Anthropic: claude-sonnet-4-6
#
# UNMAPPED_SKILL_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# UNMAPPED_NIA_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# UNMAPPED_COACH_MODEL=gpt-4o
